    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2 Storey terraced property with gardens front and rear.  Located on the western side of Cobh town within 5 minutes of shops and other amenities and on bus route to Cork city.\r\n\r\nThe property is in need of refurbishment and modernising but will make a great starter home and would also be suited to investment purposes.\r\n\r\nHeating is solid fuel from back boiler (requires replacement). Fireplace in both sitting room and kitchen.\r\n\r\nThe property has been vacant for two years & the purchaser may qualify for the vacant property refurbishment grant."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch entry.\r\nHall\r\n4.11 x 1.65\r\n\r\nSittingroom\r\n3.38 x 2.9 with brick fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.91 x 3.4 also with fireplace\r\n\r\nUtility room\r\n2.13 x 0.61\r\n\r\nRear Porch\r\n1.22 x 0.61 : with sliding doors \r\n\r\nFirst Floor:-\r\nLanding\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.94 x 3.3 : Rear aspect \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.61 x.2.5 : Front aspect\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.62 x 2.42 : Front aspect\r\n\r\nBathroom \r\n6 x 5.10\r\nWhb, wc & bath"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "cul de sac\r\nclose to all amenities \r\non street parking\r\nsolid fuel heating \r\nTimber & concrete shed"
      },
